## Context

### Work completed this run
- **Phase 2: Immune cell-type enrichment** — implemented and ran 03_celltype_enrichment.py. MAGMA-style continuous association + Wilcoxon competitive tests on 18,864 genes using DICE specificity scores (9 grouped + 25 subtype). Commit 6ba7460.

### Key finding
- **Plasmablasts: FDR=0.001** — only cell subtype surviving multiple testing correction. Supports autoantibody/PANDAS mechanism in TS. Signal at subtype level but not grouped B_cell level.
- DC nominally significant (P=0.018, FDR=0.163). CD4_T borderline in competitive test (P=0.050). Priority types Th17/NK not significant.

### Previously completed (phases 1, 1b)
- Phase 1 LDSC genetic correlations: 0/16 diseases FDR<0.05. Commit 88e60d6.
- Phase 1b lymphocytic enrichment: DICE_CD4_T borderline Wilcoxon (P=0.050). Commit 009862e.

